			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Format CheckKeybindingConflicts command signature\n\nReflow the function signature for `CheckKeybindingConflicts` in `Source/Command/Keybinding/CheckKeybindingConflicts.rs` to place all parameters on a single line.\n\nThis change aligns the code with the project's Rust formatting standards and ensures consistency with the recent modularization efforts in `WindServiceHandlers`. The logic and functionality remain unchanged; this is purely a stylistic adjustment to improve readability and maintain a uniform codebase structure.",
			"SHA": "c71126c2c31b16ebd36602c62fe2f9438ccc81ad"
