			"Message": "chore(Mountain): Remove empty Permission role management stub\n\nDelete the `ManageRole.rs` file under `Source/IPC/Permission/Role/`, which existed as an empty placeholder with zero bytes. This cleanup aligns with the recent architectural shift toward inline permission validation and specific handler implementations, removing dead code artifacts that no longer serve a function in the IPC layer.\n\nThe removal ensures the permission directory structure accurately reflects the current state of the codebase, preventing confusion from orphaned files and maintaining consistency with the modularization efforts in `WindServiceHandlers` and `ValidatePermission`.",
